# A46: idle dump, then hover the File title (88,8) to drop the menu and dump it
# (the separators). Works for TeraDesk (#Z) and for our desktop alike: the
# scratch injector arms on the first AES pump of the first EL0 program OR on
# "[desk] desktop up" (A46 dual arming, scratch copy only).
1100 mark A_IDLE
1200 park
1206 move 300 300
1400 move 88 8
2000 mark C_FILE_MENU
